        "exact_excerpt": "  From \nthese  places  the  rovers  issued  to  capture,  to  destroy, \nand  to  enslave :  in  Oran  and  Tlemcen,  in  Tenes, \nShershell,  Bougie,  Jigelli,  Bizerta,  Sfax,  Susa, \nMonastir,  Jerbah,  and  Tripoli  they  lurked  ready \nfor  the  raid  and  the  foray.",
        "attribution": "stated"
